          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Hakuoro, a man who wakes up in a tiny backwoods village near the mountains with heavy injuries, no memory, and a mask he cannot remove. After being nursed back to health by Eruruw, the girl who found him lying at the point of death in the forest, he starts to view the village as his new home. But when an oppressive ruler threatens the peaceful life of Hakuoro and his newfound friends and family, they find themselves hurtled towards war, chaos, and a destiny far greater than any of them imagined.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Hakuoro, un hombre que despierta en una pequeña aldea apartada cerca de las montañas, con heridas graves, sin memoria y con una máscara que no puede quitarse. Tras ser cuidado hasta recuperarse por Eruruw, la muchacha que lo encontró moribundo en el bosque, empieza a ver la aldea como su nuevo hogar. Pero cuando un gobernante opresor amenaza la vida pacífica de Hakuoro y de sus nuevos amigos y familia, se ven arrastrados hacia la guerra, el caos y un destino mucho mayor de lo que cualquiera de ellos habría imaginado.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2002",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
