        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Utawarerumono: Past and Present Rediscovered is a role-playing game developed by Aquaplus. It is a sequel to Monochrome Mobius: Rights and Wrongs Forgotten and takes place before the events of Utawarerumono: Mask of Deception. The story follows Oshtor and his allies after their return to Yamato, where new incidents and monster appearances begin to affect the empire. Unlike the main Utawarerumono visual novel/strategy entries, it uses turn-based combat in the style of Monochrome Mobius.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Utawarerumono: Past and Present Rediscovered es un juego de rol desarrollado por Aquaplus. Es la secuela de Monochrome Mobius: Rights and Wrongs Forgotten y transcurre antes de los sucesos de Utawarerumono: Mask of Deception. La historia sigue a Oshtor y sus aliados tras su regreso a Yamato, donde nuevos incidentes y apariciones de monstruos empiezan a afectar al imperio. A diferencia de las entradas principales de novela visual y estrategia de Utawarerumono, usa combate por turnos al estilo de Monochrome Mobius.",
